# .dev.vars.example
# This file is a template for local development secrets.
# Copy this file to .dev.vars and fill in the values.
# The .dev.vars file is ignored by Git and should NOT be committed.
#
# Usage:
#   cp .dev.vars.example .dev.vars
#   # Then edit .dev.vars with your actual secret values
#
# These variables are automatically available in your Worker's `env` parameter
# during local development with `npm run dev`.

# Anthropic API Key (for Claude API integration)
# Get your key at: https://console.anthropic.com/
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-api03-...

# OpenAI API Key (if using OpenAI integration)
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# Other secrets for your application
# DATABASE_PASSWORD=your-secret-password
# JWT_SECRET=your-jwt-secret
